  - In the table:
    - "Sign-in failed" rows get a danger Badge that contains the text, so color is never the only cue.
    - The table gets a caption that states the time zone, for example "Times in Pacific Time (UTC−07:00)", because
      filtering by day only makes sense if people know which zone the days are in.
  - Filter state is not put in the URL. It can be added later if people want shareable links.

